<title>NETHERLANDS: FRANS MAAS '96 NET IN LINE WITH FORECAST.</title>
<headline>FRANS MAAS '96 NET IN LINE WITH FORECAST.</headline>
<dateline>VENLO, Netherlands 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     4.71 vs   3.45</p>
<p>    Total net profit		    24.4  vs  17.9</p>
<p>    Net from ordinary operations    25.0  vs  18.4</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  1.90 vs   1.40</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)		  1.23 vs   1.19</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    51.5  vs  45.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Road transport firm Koninklijke Frans Maas Groep NV,</p>
<p>in which KLM Royal Dutch Airlines holds a minority stake, said</p>
<p>in February it expected a 1996 net of more than 24 mln guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
